 *   <li>{@link #sign()} — direction (place/break/neutral) used by sign-filtered
 *       lookups ({@code a:+block} vs {@code a:-block}).</li>
 * </ul>
 *
 * <p>Lookup helpers {@link #byId(int)} and {@link #byToken(String)} provide
